        "description": "Data flow for connecting a client's bank account via Plaid. Staff log in and request a bank link for a client through Azure Functions, which requests a link token from Plaid and returns it to the browser. Staff then deliver the resulting link to the bank client manually, outside the app, since the bank client never has a session with this application directly. The bank client completes Plaid's Hosted Link on their own, entering bank credentials with Plaid only. Plaid then sends a webhook back to Azure Functions, which writes the resulting account and token data to Azure SQL."
